fSaCD0_v735XMJ-3K8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL1K3Y85N-o3JcqrXZnVVyIXZLVp3Fu5_WsG_N9lxDSVQ&oe=6AAFFA71"}, {"file_name": "8K (13).png", "id": "1526092652361771", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623601_1526092655695104_2955557365843293793_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gPevFNkGYGQQ7kNvwGLQPO0&_nc_oc=AdrTQrG0dq7naM0k2NZC1G1266Po-TAKmYSaBU3T3s1qDgQTTX61xwhWa3NoXef-gzk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJlPCzBTkQyEMYp5WebpQs2pgOQmDFcmlEIN9bP4Wc5rQ&oe=6AAFD41F"}, {"file_name": "8K (4).png", "id": "1299212628296686", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618093_1299212631630019_252916575612329108_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=c5pOYZjy9HEQ7kNvwEWODfy&_nc_oc=AdoDfQXYsaM0565czS4lWkrGdaAIGGg8MJ1sCkKEUfoEcXPR3wBT8jJNug2zilrSIRI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKM1-IpiYrLtzwLBAVNkBb7eofKClss6LxH_FG0pt0JZA&oe=6AAFE669"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Dreams and Desires_Cover Landscape_2560x1440 (1).png", "id": "1531036808378264", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618440_1531036811711597_3533717181797400065_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XYRuaPn-1OwQ7kNvwFYtLkk&_nc_oc=AdqmjZ3VO057rZ3bCiJGBy1Zt8JZRXqViy2Rx9B3VyBxPeyXuYQOI3UEdPzDARrjjoY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIa7RSm0ofUQ1j1qdf20XUY6QTUmGj647Z0mx7tT-wxtg&oe=6AAFD40B"}, "display_name": "Dreams and Desires", "keywords": [], "long_description": "You\u2019re the new intern. Nobody knows you yet. That\u2019s an advantage.\n\nNova Prime VR is the kind of place where careers are made fast\u2014and trust is lost even faster. You have one shot to figure out who matters and what you\u2019re willing to do about it.\n\nDreams & Desires is a live-action interactive story shot with real actors in real locations. Every scene is 360\u00b0\u2014wear your headset and stand inside the room. The story doesn\u2019t change. The feeling does.\n\n# What Makes It Different:\n\n\u2013 Real actors, practical sets\u2014not animation, not motion capture\n\u2013 Every location in full 360\u00b0\u2014the whole room exists\n\u2013 Branching dialogue with real stakes\u2014choices close doors\n\u2013 Built for replay\u2014second runs reveal scenes you couldn\u2019t reach before\n\u2013 Built from the ground up for VR\u2014not adapted for it\n\n{1533365231742894}\n\n# Four people. One internship. No easy answers.\n\nLily: In your corner since day one. Quiet, steady, paying more attention than you realize.\n{983095517535492}\n\nStacy: Works the bar downstairs. Fast with a comeback, slow to trust.\n{861958073585054}\n\nJessica: Runs the office like she\u2019s seen every version of you. Hard to impress.\n{1480159677246775}\n\nKate: She trains like every second counts. No patience for half-efforts.\n{1016263437729312}\n\n# Every Choice Costs Something\nConversations branch as you go. Say the wrong thing and you lose someone you need. Your career and your relationships feel separate\u2014until one starts wrecking the other. Four possible endings: career, romance, both, or neither. Each one is earned, not given.\n{1061285089805045}", "short_description": "Real choices. Real people. Real locations. A first-of-its-kind live-action 360\u00b0 VR adventure where every decision shape the story. Balance a high-stakes internship with real connections across campus, office, gym, and bar. Explore, decide, and replay branching routes and multiple endings."}]}, "developer_name": "Arcade VR Labs", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://dreamsdesires.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://dreamsdesires.com/terms-and-conditions", "publisher_name": "Arcade VR Labs", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://arcadevr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_ta